--[[
    ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
    MINIGAMES v1.0.0
    ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

    multiplayer gta online minigames and wargames tools for cherax.

    description:
    - provides wargames vehicle rounds, player routing, bounties, respawning, and cleanup
    - includes the purge, land on it, driftgod, and future game placeholders
    - keeps all runtime modules embedded inside one distributable lua file
    - stores settings, assets, diagnostics, and recovery data under cherax\lua\minigames

    controls:
    - open the minigames tab from cherax
    - teleport players before activating wargames when practical
    - activate one game at a time and use its play/config pages for live controls

    notes:
    - phone messaging, messenger, and smart voting remain disabled for production
    - minigame starts remain unlimited while public-session testing continues
    - runtime-facing cherax api names and compatibility fields retain their required casing
    - internal comments and the primary script namespace use lower-case release-source style
    - direct calls now replace every protected call; runtime errors are allowed to surface normally

    changelog:
    - v1.0.0 - initial production release.

    developed by: Public_Urinal
    credits: Built with assistance from ChatGPT.

    ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
]]

