-- v0.084 final hud strategy
------------------------------------------------------------
-- confirmed:
-- - native draw hud is the only version that reliably appears as an
--   always-on in-game hud.
-- - native draw hud is visual only and cannot be clicked.
-- - clickable controls must live inside the cherax / imgui menu.
