------------------------------------------------------------
-- v0.115 final override: serialized remote respawn stability
------------------------------------------------------------
-- log diagnosis:
-- v0.114 successfully watched all 21 players and spawned multiple khanjalis.
-- it then hit a native crash stack around set_entity_as_mission_entity/delete_entity
-- while bounties + cleanup + rapid remote respawn spawns were all active.
--
-- stabilization rules:
-- 1) keep remote respawn watcher on.
-- 2) serialize respawn spawns: one queued vehicle at a time.
-- 3) never hard-delete wargames vehicles automatically during remote respawn.
-- 4) disable auto vehicle cleanup/fair delete paths during wargames respawn.
-- 5) stop 21-player bounty bursts; use slow/safe bounty pacing only.
------------------------------------------------------------

